{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 1, "text": "하이요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 2, "text": "앗!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 3, "text": "죄송해요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 4, "text": "큰일 날 뻔했네요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 5, "text": "어… 그게…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 6, "text": "그러니까 냉장고가 넘어질 뻔했다고요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 7, "text": "전 아무것도 안 했어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 8, "text": "맹세해요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 9, "text": "진짜라니까요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 10, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 11, "text": "알았어, 믿을게!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 12, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 13, "text": "사실…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 14, "text": "여긴 위험한 곳이에요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 15, "text": "특히 당신한테는 더더욱…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 17, "text": "// After a while 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 18, "text": "의외로 겁이 없네요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 19, "text": "당신을 관찰하는 게 너무 재밌어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 20, "text": "지금까지 겪어온 일들을"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 21, "text": "지켜보고 있자니…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 22, "text": "어서 도망가요, 플레이어님!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 23, "text": "제가 금방 쫓아갈게요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 24, "text": "빨리, 더 빨리!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 25, "text": "너무 재밌다아!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 27, "text": "// After a while 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 28, "text": "전철 쪽으로 가는 걸 봤어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 29, "text": "그건 각 버전 간에서"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 30, "text": "제일 긴 루트인데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 31, "text": "궁금하네요,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 32, "text": "그곳의 존재를 어떻게 상대하고"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 33, "text": "그 상황들을 어떻게 헤쳐나갈지…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 35, "text": "// Panties"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 36, "text": "뭐 하는 거예요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 37, "text": "아이참…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 38, "text": "그만 보시라고요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 39, "text": "바보!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 40, "text": "바보 멍청이…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 43, "text": "하아, 알겠어요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 46, "text": "행운을 빌게요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 49, "text": "누구야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 50, "text": "누군가 있는 게 느껴져…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 51, "text": "내 말 좀 들어줘."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 52, "text": "너 플레이어지?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 53, "text": "그렇지?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 54, "text": "나 좀 도와줘…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 55, "text": "뭔가를 찾아야 해…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 56, "text": "근데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 57, "text": "그게 뭔지 기억이 안 나…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 58, "text": "도대체 무슨 일이 벌어지고 있는 거지?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 59, "text": "// Cry 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 60, "text": "모든 걸 잊고 싶었어…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 61, "text": "거울은 다 부숴버리고,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 62, "text": "사진도 전부 찢어버렸는데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 63, "text": "지금 와서 보니…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 64, "text": "그것마저 후회되네."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 65, "text": "정말 바보 같았어…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 66, "text": "누구나 실수는 하지만,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 67, "text": "돌이킬 수 없는 일이 되어버리면"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 68, "text": "그땐 어떻게 해야 하는 걸까…?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 69, "text": "이 모든 게 꿈이었으면…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 70, "text": "// Cry 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 71, "text": "시간이 지나면 다 괜찮아진다더니…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 72, "text": "그 시간이란 게 대체 뭐지?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 73, "text": "이젠 뭘 믿어야 할지도 모르겠어…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 74, "text": "시간이 정말 다 치유한다면"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 75, "text": "날 데려가 줘."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 76, "text": "이 세계로부터…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 77, "text": "제발"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 78, "text": "부탁이야."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 79, "text": "빨리…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 80, "text": "빨리 와서 날 끝내줘."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 81, "text": "// Cry 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 82, "text": "그 애는 사랑을 했어…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 83, "text": "나도 누군가를 사랑했을까?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 84, "text": "그래도 그 애만큼은 아니겠지."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 85, "text": "그 애의 사랑은 너무 화끈했고,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 86, "text": "귀찮고…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 87, "text": "정열적이고…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 88, "text": "이기적이기도 했고…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 89, "text": "질투심 많고…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 90, "text": "악의에 차있고…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 91, "text": "너무 미쳐있었어…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 92, "text": "// Cry 4"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 93, "text": "다들 내가 너무 예민하다고 하지…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 94, "text": "\"미타야, 넌 생각이 너무 많아…\""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 95, "text": "\"괜찮을 거야, 미타야…\""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 96, "text": "\"넌 혼자가 아니야…\""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 97, "text": "근데 결국… 남은 게 뭐야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 98, "text": "슬픔,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 99, "text": "절망…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 100, "text": "그리고 두려움 밖에 없잖아."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 101, "text": "// Cry 5"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 102, "text": "소용없어…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 103, "text": "아무리 해도 기억이 안 나…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 104, "text": "온몸에 힘이 빠지고…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 105, "text": "그리고 끝없는 메아리…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 106, "text": "여기 갇혀있다는 생각만 들면…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 107, "text": "도저히 견딜 수가 없어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 108, "text": "계속 여기 갇혀있었는데,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 109, "text": "대체 왜…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 110, "text": "기억이 안 나지?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 111, "text": "이 모든 건 과연 끝이 날까…?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 112, "text": "모르겠어..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 113, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 114, "text": "// Mita get picture"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 115, "text": "이건…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 116, "text": "이 그림…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 117, "text": "드디어 기억났어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 118, "text": "고마워…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 119, "text": "하지만 얼굴이…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 120, "text": "난 얼굴이 없어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 121, "text": "전부 다 그 애 때문이야."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 122, "text": "내 일부를 빼앗아서…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 123, "text": "허공 속에 던져버렸어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 124, "text": "그 애는 너무 강해…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 125, "text": "똑똑하고…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 126, "text": "당신을 막고 싶진 않아."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 127, "text": "옷장 한번 봐봐."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 130, "text": "저기요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 131, "text": "길 막지 마세요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 132, "text": "계속 그렇게 서 있을 건가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 133, "text": "비켜주세요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 134, "text": "지나가게 해줘요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 135, "text": "키 큰 게 뭐 대수라고!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 136, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 137, "text": "// HEY! STOP!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 138, "text": "그만 따라오세요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 139, "text": "저리 가요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 141, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 143, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 144, "text": "// Funicular - radio voice"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 145, "text": "잠시만요, 플레이어님?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 146, "text": "여기는 어쩐 일이신가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 147, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 148, "text": "누구더라?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 149, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 150, "text": "아, 역시 플레이어시네요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 151, "text": "저는 미타라고 해요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 152, "text": "여기서 케이블카를 원격 조종하고 있어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 153, "text": "그래서 말인데,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 154, "text": "지금 막다른 길로 가고 있는 것 같아요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 155, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 156, "text": "아닌데."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 157, "text": "하지만 이 길밖에 없잖아."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 159, "text": "알겠어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 160, "text": "그럼 버튼 누르고 포탑 뒤로 와주세요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 161, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 162, "text": "포탑이라고?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 163, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 164, "text": "맞아요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 165, "text": "핸들만 돌리면 될 줄 아셨어요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 166, "text": "몬스터 슬랩 미니게임도 클리어해야 해요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 167, "text": "자, 사격 준비하세요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 168, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 169, "text": "// Funicular go"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 170, "text": "좋아요, 출발합니다."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 171, "text": "// Funicular win"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 172, "text": "대단해요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 173, "text": "클리어하셨네요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 174, "text": "// Funicular stop"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 175, "text": "자, 어서 내리세요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 176, "text": "서두르세요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 177, "text": "// Funicular wait 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 178, "text": "거기서 뭐 하시는 거예요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 179, "text": "내리시라니까요~"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 180, "text": "// Funicular wait 4"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 181, "text": "이해가 안 되네요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 182, "text": "진짜 그렇게 서 계실 건가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 183, "text": "// Funicular tetris"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 184, "text": "이 게임기는 뭔가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 185, "text": "아이참…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 186, "text": "// Funicular goodbye"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 187, "text": "안녕히 가세요."}
